<noinclude>
Stores one day's tracked time as SMW properties (Tt day/customer/job/task/user/duration/notes): the running total
(decimal hours) a user worked on a job on a day. <code>customer</code> and <code>job</code> hold page ids; names
resolve at display time via DisplayTitle. One entry per customer/job/task/user/day — the stopwatch
([[Special:TimeTracker]]) and the weekly timesheet grid accumulate into it. Written by the extension, not by hand.
[[Category:Time tracker templates]]
</noinclude><includeonly>{{#set:
|Tt day={{{day|}}}
|Tt customer={{{customer|}}}
|Tt job={{{job|}}}
|Tt task={{{task|}}}
|Tt user={{{user|}}}
|Tt duration={{{duration|}}}
|Tt notes={{{notes|}}}
}}{{DISPLAYTITLE:{{{day|}}}{{#if:{{{job|}}}| — {{#getdisplaytitle:{{{job}}}}}|}}}}<div class="tt-card tt-entity">
<div class="tt-facts">
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Day</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{{day|—}}}</span></div>
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Duration</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{#timetracker_format_duration:{{{duration|0}}}}}</span></div>
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Customer</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{#if:{{{customer|}}}|[[{{{customer}}}]]|—}}</span></div>
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Job</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{#if:{{{job|}}}|[[{{{job}}}]]|—}}</span></div>
{{#if:{{{task|}}}|<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">Task</span><span class="tt-fact-value">[[{{{task}}}]]</span></div>|}}
<div class="tt-fact"><span class="tt-fact-label">User</span><span class="tt-fact-value">{{{user|—}}}</span></div>
</div>{{#if:{{{notes|}}}|<div class="tt-desc">{{{notes}}}</div>|}}
</div>
[[Category:Time entries]]
</includeonly>
